# Optional. Leave unset in development: the app reuses the Metro host (your LAN IP) on port 8080,
# so a physical phone on the same Wi-Fi reaches the Go API automatically.
# Set it to point at a deployed API (EAS profiles in eas.json set it per build).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com

# Needed to build onto your own iPhone (`pnpm exec expo run:ios --device`) with your own
# Apple ID. Bundle IDs belong to one Apple team, so each developer picks a unique one.
# After changing it, run `pnpm exec expo prebuild --platform ios --clean`.
# IOS_BUNDLE_ID=com.yourname.orbit
